@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = paste_supabase_access_token
@caseId = paste_case_uuid
@shareId = paste_share_id

### Preflight -> 204
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/cases
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Authorization, Content-Type

### Unauthorized create -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases
Origin: http://localhost:3000

### Create case -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photoMode"

body_visible
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
--boundary--

### Owner get -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My Flyers -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid UUID -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Patch metadata -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appearance": {
    "top": { "status": "known", "color": "blue", "type": "반팔 티셔츠", "brand": null },
    "bottom": { "status": "unknown" },
    "hat": { "status": "none" },
    "shoes": { "status": "unknown" },
    "items": [{ "type": "지팡이", "color": "brown" }]
  },
  "name": "홍길동",
  "age": 72,
  "heightCm": 168,
  "missingAt": "2026-09-12 10:00",
  "place": "서울역",
  "contact": "010-0000-0000",
  "contactDisclosureConsent": true
}

### Generate -> 200, requires GEMINI_API_KEY
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Publish -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public flyer PNG -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flyer/{{shareId}}

### Public flyer meta -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flyer/{{shareId}}/meta

### Delete -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cleanup -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cron/cleanup
Authorization: Bearer paste_cron_secret
